"Adapter statistics are collected continuously while NetFluss runs. App statistics come from Windows' own data usage records." = "NetFluss 執行期間會持續收集介面卡統計。App 統計來自 Windows 本身的數據使用量記錄。";
"Added “%@”." = "已新增「%@」。";
"Adds NetFluss to your sign-in apps, where Task Manager can also turn it off." = "將 NetFluss 加入登入時啟動的應用程式，也可在工作管理員中將其關閉。";
"Adds a VPN connection set up in Windows Settings, so NetFluss can connect it from the popover." = "新增在 Windows 設定中設定的 VPN 連線，讓 NetFluss 可從彈出視窗中連線。";
"Add…" = "新增…";
"An always-on-top panel you can drag anywhere. Works alongside the other placements, and depends on nothing that a Windows update can move." = "永遠置頂、可拖曳到任意位置的面板。可與其他位置同時使用，不依賴任何可能因 Windows 更新而改變的內容。";
"An app stays listed for a few seconds after it goes quiet, so the list does not reshuffle between bursts." = "App 停止傳輸後仍會保留幾秒，避免清單在流量間隙中頻繁重排。";
