"Windows only lets administrators watch connections by app and host. The optional NetFluss helper does it for you; installing it asks for approval once." = "Windows 只允許系統管理員依 App 和主機查看連線。選用的 NetFluss 輔助工具可代為完成；安裝時會要求核准一次。";
"Windows only lets administrators watch per-app network traffic, so Top Apps uses the optional helper service. Install it under General → System access." = "Windows 只允許系統管理員查看每個 App 的網路流量，因此熱門 App 使用選用的輔助服務。請在「一般 → 系統存取」中安裝。";
"Windows only lets administrators watch per-app network traffic. The optional NetFluss helper does it for you; installing it asks for approval once." = "Windows 只允許系統管理員查看每個 App 的網路流量。選用的 NetFluss 輔助工具可代為完成；安裝時會要求核准一次。";
"Windows refused the network settings (error %@)." = "Windows 拒絕了網路設定（錯誤 %@）。";
