"This NetFluss is older than its helper. Update NetFluss, or reinstall the helper from this version, to see who this PC is talking to." = "此 NetFluss 比其輔助工具舊。請更新 NetFluss，或重新安裝此版本的輔助工具，以查看這台電腦正在與誰通訊。";
"Installed, version %@ — newer than this NetFluss (%@). Update NetFluss, or reinstall the helper from this version." = "已安裝，版本 %@ —— 比此 NetFluss（%@）新。請更新 NetFluss，或重新安裝此版本的輔助工具。";
